From 87dacc315d85ca9d375655cc8580087b6232322f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "yao.tsai" <oe.patch@oe>
Date: Wed, 4 Feb 2026 11:26:32 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] modify for stark SOF driver with codec rt5650

- use soc_device_match() to check stark/kent
- bl31: support SOF_FW(0xff0b) in RTK_VERIFY_FIT_IMAGES(0x8400ff39)
- modify poweron/poweroff flow according to HIFI spec
- dts: modify bleedingedge/backinblack with hdmi audio
- dts: disable hifi_rproc, which is for non-SOF HIFI FW
- dts: disable hifi-rpmsg and rtk_urpc_service
- drm: rtk_hdmi: register hdmi codec for sof on CHROME_PLATFORMS
